  "description": "Our V-Series bikes give you serious performance, but come at a budget-friendly price. We outfit our V-Series machines with aggressive frames and back them with value-laden components that give you the best mix of performance and durability you’ll find for the money. We don’t believe in dumbed-down mountain bikes. Our V-Series machines use high-end performance geometry, so you get stable handling and crisp response, and a riding position with perfect weight distribution for comfort and stability. Proven, reliable drivetrain components on every V-Series bike matched with surefooted tires make riding easier and more enjoyable. And with powerful brakes (including disc brakes on the top-tier V4), you’ll ride with skill-building confidence. With prices starting at just $240, and 20” and 24” kids’ and youth models available, the V-Series is just what you need to get the family out on the trail, with performance to grow into.",
